Rādhā-bhajan, then his Krishna-bhajan goes for nothing."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["ātapa-rohita sūray nāhi jāni","rādhā-birahita mādhav nāhi māni"],"translation":["Without sunlight the sun cannot be seen, similarly I don’t pay any mind to Krishna without Rādhā."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["kevala mādhav pūjaye so ajñānī","rādhā anādara karai abhimānī"],"translation":["One who worships Krishna alone is ignorant. Who does not adore Śrī Rādhā is an egotist."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["kobohi nāhi karabi tā̐kor saṅga","chitte ichāsi jadi vraja-rasa-raṅga"],"translation":["Never keep company with those who envy Rādhā if within your heart you at all aspire to the loving Pastimes of Vraja."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["rādhikā-dāsī jodi hoy abhimān","śīghrai milai tava gokula kān"],"translation":["Those who consider themselves maidservants of Śrī Rādhā will quickly meet Gokul-Krishna."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["brahmā, śiva, nārada, śruti, nārāyaṇī","rādhikā-pada-raja pūjaye māni"],"translation":["Brahmā, Shiva, Nārada, the śrutis, and Nārāyaṇī (Lakṣmī) worship with regard the holy feet of Śrī Rādhā."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["umā, ramā, satyā, śachī, chandrā, rukmiṇī","rādhā-avatār sobe, —āmnāya-vāṇī"],"translation":["Umā, Ramā, Satyā, Śachī, Chandrāvālī, and Rukminī are all personal expansions of Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī — this is the self-evident verdict of the Vedas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["heno rādhā-paricharjyā jā̐kara dhana","bhakativinoda tā̐ra māgaye charaṇa"],"translation":["Bhakti Vinod, whose only wealth is the service of Śrī Rādhā, humbly prays to be a serving maid at Her lotus feet."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/31-radha-bhajane-yadi-8","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.